# Create a group. Start the API with Aspire first, then send "Create an account" once.
@host = http://localhost:5279

### Create an account → 201. The requests below use its access token.
# @name createAccount
POST {{host}}/api/v1/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user-{{$guid}}@example.com",
  "password": "password",
  "timeZone": "Europe/Zagreb"
}

### A new group → 201. Send it twice: the second time is 409 group.name_taken.
POST {{host}}/api/v1/groups
Authorization: Bearer {{createAccount.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Core"
}

### A blank name → 400 validation.
POST {{host}}/api/v1/groups
Authorization: Bearer {{createAccount.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": " "
}
